WEBVTT

00:01:45.739 --> 00:01:51.287
- I hear you're fighting Yujiro.
--Strydom-san! Where is he?!

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:55.258
Not so fast. You still have a month.

00:01:55.282 --> 00:01:59.150
I'll beat him!
I'll get stronger than him!

00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:13.142
--Go to Hokkaido.
--Hokkaido...?

00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:16.245
There you will find your battlefield.

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:21.751
A scene of carnage that would easily
rival Yujiro's own battlefields.

00:02:21.775 --> 00:02:27.873
"Battlefield"

00:02:34.054 --> 00:02:37.233
Are all parachutes this tight?

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:41.371
Don't complain.
Your life is in its hands.

00:02:41.395 --> 00:02:45.541
Though one in a hundred
apparently don't open...

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:48.057
--One minute to drop.
--One minute to drop.

00:02:51.905 --> 00:02:57.420
One last thing- there's only
five of 'em, but they're real pros.

00:02:57.444 --> 00:03:00.423
You'll be discovered
from the moment you jump!

00:03:00.447 --> 00:03:03.593
Do not leave the area where you land!

00:03:03.617 --> 00:03:05.328
--Course set!
--Course set!

00:03:05.352 --> 00:03:08.151
Go! Go kick some ass!

00:03:49.296 --> 00:03:51.287
What now?

00:03:52.199 --> 00:03:55.611
How am I supposed to
fight with nobody here?

00:03:55.635 --> 00:03:58.696
| can't just stand around here...

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:04.187
| don't understand this map!
It's all lines!

00:04:04.211 --> 00:04:08.375
Let's see. I landed near a swamp, so...

00:04:42.482 --> 00:04:43.659
It's a kid.

00:04:43.683 --> 00:04:50.066
He came in with a chute,
so I figured he was some paratrooper.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:53.424
Not even the SDF- just some kid.

00:05:05.772 --> 00:05:10.253
Wow. I had to use cesium gas on him.

00:05:10.277 --> 00:05:12.989
Never thought I'd need
it in a real fight.

00:05:13.013 --> 00:05:18.008
--He's seen our faces.
--Yeah. Can't let him go now.

00:05:30.397 --> 00:05:31.660
There.

00:05:34.467 --> 00:05:35.945
We gonna dispose of him?

00:05:35.969 --> 00:05:41.806
Meeting us means death.
There's no law out here.

00:05:43.043 --> 00:05:46.122
I'd say he's 65 or 66 kilograms.

00:05:46.146 --> 00:05:49.525
Very little body fat.
He's almost entirely muscle.

00:05:49.549 --> 00:05:51.727
He's really trained himself.

00:05:51.751 --> 00:05:54.379
So he's no ordinary kid?

00:05:58.658 --> 00:06:00.956
Well, let's get it over with.

00:06:03.897 --> 00:06:06.742
--Wait.
--What for?

00:06:06.766 --> 00:06:12.048
He might not be alone. He could
have some friends in hiding.

00:06:12.072 --> 00:06:14.650
Leave him alive for now.

00:06:14.674 --> 00:06:15.664
Here.

00:06:16.843 --> 00:06:20.056
If we're gonna kill him,
we should have fun.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:25.294
Right. Now then, what do we do?

00:06:25.318 --> 00:06:28.164
If we want to prolong the fun,
we could--

00:06:28.188 --> 00:06:33.336
An herb ointment.
Stops bleeding like a charm.

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:36.159
That's why this is going to be so fun.

00:06:47.073 --> 00:06:49.619
It's good to see you again, Sir.

00:06:49.643 --> 00:06:53.978
How goes it, Mister Strydom?

00:06:55.415 --> 00:06:57.260
How long are you in Japan?

00:06:57.284 --> 00:07:01.118
Good question. I'd really
like to stay in hiding...

00:07:02.322 --> 00:07:06.350
You, in hiding?
Doesn't seem like you at all.

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:11.073
You're known as a soldier among soldiers.

00:07:11.097 --> 00:07:14.176
The battlefield is the
only place for you to die.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:19.982
A soldier among soldiers?
Perhaps as a commanding officer...

00:07:20.006 --> 00:07:22.485
How about as a soldier?

00:07:22.509 --> 00:07:26.188
I don't know. I prefer
to choose my opponents.

00:07:26.212 --> 00:07:28.704
How about Yujiro Hanma?

00:07:33.219 --> 00:07:39.969
The only people I can't beat are
that ogre and one other person.

00:07:39.993 --> 00:07:45.508
I've sent that ogre's son
to Hokkaido as a soldier.

00:07:45.532 --> 00:07:47.176
Interesting.

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:51.881
He wished to experience
as much as his father did...

00:07:51.905 --> 00:07:53.716
Like father, like son.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:57.267
Now to see if he can defeat those five...

00:07:59.646 --> 00:08:01.390
Did you say five?

00:08:01.414 --> 00:08:04.042
Yes, that's right...

00:08:06.753 --> 00:08:13.969
Strydom. Among those five is
the other person I can't beat.

00:08:13.993 --> 00:08:19.275
--Are you aware Gaia is with them?!
--You mean he's alive?!

00:08:19.299 --> 00:08:25.414
He's known as Mister War-
not even a nuke could kill him!

00:08:25.438 --> 00:08:27.750
You were rash, Strydom!

00:08:27.774 --> 00:08:32.555
Unbelievable! Which of them is Gaia?!

00:08:32.579 --> 00:08:39.528
Just ask the Ogre's son.
Assuming he survives, of course.

00:08:39.552 --> 00:08:44.066
But Baki is the Ogre's son!
He won't be that easily--

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:48.270
You only say that because
you don't know Gaia's wrath.

00:08:48.294 --> 00:08:53.242
His deadly techniques on the
battlefield are second to none.

00:08:53.266 --> 00:08:58.714
Once you've encountered Gaia on
the battlefield, it's all over...

00:08:58.738 --> 00:09:02.368
...even for the Ogre!

00:09:19.092 --> 00:09:22.138
You're still nearby.

00:09:22.162 --> 00:09:25.029
I'm right here!

00:09:33.106 --> 00:09:38.135
I'm no medic. I won't stop the bleeding.

00:09:39.813 --> 00:09:43.726
Don't worry. I only cut
the great saphenous vein.

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:47.430
It's a low pressure vein-
it'll bleed slowly.

00:09:47.454 --> 00:09:52.290
If you can beat me in 5 minutes,
you'll survive!

00:09:54.494 --> 00:09:56.223
Good eyes!

00:09:59.299 --> 00:10:02.132
I have more than one knife!

00:10:12.812 --> 00:10:16.659
This knife was specially
made by a master blacksmith.

00:10:16.683 --> 00:10:20.196
It has the sharpest edge in the world!

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:24.266
The handle's weight,
the razor-sharp edge...

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:28.537
Whadya think? Nice shave, huh?

00:10:28.561 --> 00:10:30.552
Why, you...!

00:10:32.866 --> 00:10:35.377
You want some of this?!

00:10:35.401 --> 00:10:37.880
Fine by me!

00:10:37.904 --> 00:10:39.531
The carotid artery...!

00:10:43.009 --> 00:10:44.477
The crotch...!

00:10:56.122 --> 00:10:58.701
Your rushing needs work, kid.

00:10:58.725 --> 00:11:03.305
A few more centimeters and your
wrist would've been gushing...!

00:11:03.329 --> 00:11:07.459
He's luring me in and
attacking my weak points...!

00:11:12.872 --> 00:11:17.070
Here's a wrist or two for ya!

00:11:24.384 --> 00:11:27.183
Or not!

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:33.684
You weak spot freak!

00:11:53.746 --> 00:11:55.891
I'm gonna get some exercise.

00:11:55.915 --> 00:12:00.853
Get some sleep or look
at the stars or whatever.

00:12:04.791 --> 00:12:08.489
Alright, guys! The night game's begun!

00:12:10.229 --> 00:12:13.842
Don't tell me you've gone to sleep?!

00:12:13.866 --> 00:12:16.836
Stop acting tough and come out!

00:12:34.487 --> 00:12:38.617
Damn! And I got him with both feet...!

00:12:44.897 --> 00:12:46.991
Something's coming...

00:12:58.177 --> 00:13:02.424
Gaia is a supreme expert in
military fighting techniques.

00:13:02.448 --> 00:13:10.448
His heartless fighting style is
the very basis of those techniques.

00:13:10.623 --> 00:13:16.639
The concept of fair play on the
battlefield is actually a detriment.

00:13:16.663 --> 00:13:21.829
Even if he is the Ogre's son,
he won't escape his baptism.

00:13:24.871 --> 00:13:27.316
Dammit! That's not fair!

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:29.251
Not fair?

00:13:29.275 --> 00:13:32.655
Seems you don't know how fights
are fought on the battlefield.

00:13:32.679 --> 00:13:34.790
Shall I give you a lecture?

00:13:34.814 --> 00:13:39.081
Dammit! If this keeps up, I'm dead!

00:13:45.425 --> 00:13:48.918
If you wanna wash your face,
I'll help you!

00:14:22.695 --> 00:14:26.075
That was a great lesson, Professor!

00:14:26.099 --> 00:14:32.801
Fighting dirty is a
true battlefield lesson!

00:14:43.483 --> 00:14:45.961
I'm a changed man!

00:14:45.985 --> 00:14:49.046
Now it's time to teach my lesson!

00:14:52.725 --> 00:14:54.136
Run...?!

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:57.206
You're in no position
to tell me what to do!

00:14:57.230 --> 00:15:01.910
Doesn't matter! If you don't
wanna die, then run now!

00:15:01.934 --> 00:15:05.981
As if I'd quit in the
middle of such a fun game!

00:15:06.005 --> 00:15:09.251
Yujiro Hanma's always
on the battlefield!

00:15:09.275 --> 00:15:10.619
Hey!

00:15:10.643 --> 00:15:13.422
Did you just say Yujiro Hanma...?!

00:15:13.446 --> 00:15:17.559
What the...? How do you
know my dad's name?

00:15:17.583 --> 00:15:21.497
--You're the Ogre's son?!
--Answer me!

00:15:21.521 --> 00:15:27.770
All soldiers like us know the
big names like Ogre and Gaia.

00:15:27.794 --> 00:15:30.539
Ogre? Gaia?

00:15:30.563 --> 00:15:35.677
Yujiro Hanma fights empty-handed
and outclasses the latest weaponry.

00:15:35.701 --> 00:15:40.849
Soldiers all over the world call him
'The Ogre' out of respect and fear.

00:15:40.873 --> 00:15:44.953
--Ogre...?
--And then there's Gaia.

00:15:44.977 --> 00:15:48.379
He's currently our commander.

00:15:52.318 --> 00:15:56.965
If you're the Ogre's son, then
you know your old man's strength.

00:15:56.989 --> 00:16:01.069
On the battlefield,
Gaia is just as powerful...

00:16:01.093 --> 00:16:02.738
Kuraishi...

00:16:02.762 --> 00:16:04.753
He left.

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:16.267
One month until the operation's over.
Will it ever end?

00:16:17.743 --> 00:16:19.388
H-how__.2!

00:16:19.412 --> 00:16:22.491
This cut was yours, right?

00:16:22.515 --> 00:16:25.041
No, uh...!

00:16:28.554 --> 00:16:33.253
Geez. You're definitely not
the guy who equals my dad.

00:16:35.695 --> 00:16:38.774
Doesn't surprise me.

00:16:38.798 --> 00:16:43.278
It's not my fault; I'm just a medic...

00:16:43.302 --> 00:16:50.853
--Nomura. Where is Gaia now?
--How should I know?

00:16:50.877 --> 00:16:54.256
But... He's not far...

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:58.126
| get the feeling he's
closer than everyone thinks.

00:16:58.150 --> 00:17:03.198
And that once he comes out,
nobody will be able to stop him...

00:17:03.222 --> 00:17:07.523
No... Not until that boy dies...

00:17:10.496 --> 00:17:11.974
Smart kid.

00:17:11.998 --> 00:17:16.445
Yeah. He's not moving
an inch from those three.

00:17:16.469 --> 00:17:21.416
The Ogre's son? To think
he'd reach even us...

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:26.378
His moves are the real thing.
A little too clean, though.

00:17:28.214 --> 00:17:30.478
I'm gonna enjoy this!

00:17:50.937 --> 00:17:54.703
That's unexpected. To think
they'd come at me head on...

00:17:56.876 --> 00:17:59.311
A bear?!

00:18:00.379 --> 00:18:01.847
It's wounded!

00:18:29.742 --> 00:18:31.767
Damn you...!

00:18:38.417 --> 00:18:41.682
You brought back a bad memory...!

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:49.658
Everything you guys do pisses me off!

00:18:57.069 --> 00:18:59.470
You're really something, kid.

00:19:02.108 --> 00:19:05.988
To think you'd drive a pro this far...

00:19:06.012 --> 00:19:09.038
Playtime's over!

00:19:23.996 --> 00:19:26.208
You're really too energetic!

00:19:26.232 --> 00:19:29.978
One against many. This is
normal on the battlefield.

00:19:30.002 --> 00:19:31.970
That's right!

00:19:35.341 --> 00:19:38.572
The game's over.

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:46.145
My knife!

00:19:47.753 --> 00:19:49.152
Why, you...!

00:20:03.936 --> 00:20:07.249
Looks like this is an all-out war!

00:20:07.273 --> 00:20:10.709
In that case, I better show my true self!

00:20:11.844 --> 00:20:16.611
--As you can see...
--...we're identical twins.

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:20.295
They're going to use it on him!

00:20:20.319 --> 00:20:25.200
--We normally disguise ourselves...
--...to avoid confusing our allies.

00:20:25.224 --> 00:20:27.903
But as a team, nothing is handier!

00:20:27.927 --> 00:20:31.192
We would've rather fought your old man!

00:20:47.713 --> 00:20:50.425
Bastards...!

00:20:50.449 --> 00:20:52.928
Two guys at once...!

00:20:52.952 --> 00:20:55.182
Gaia?!

00:21:08.734 --> 00:21:10.429
Damn you!

00:21:15.841 --> 00:21:22.008
You're pretty good, but you're
nowhere near my dad's level!

00:21:35.327 --> 00:21:38.874
You thought you could beat
Yujiro Hanma like that?

00:21:38.898 --> 00:21:41.676
You're a million years too early!

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:44.813
I smell it!

00:21:44.837 --> 00:21:47.636
--Nomura!
--Stop! Nomura!

00:21:50.342 --> 00:21:55.323
The smell of- The smell of adrenaline!

00:21:55.347 --> 00:21:58.560
It's all over! Hanma! Run!

00:21:58.584 --> 00:22:03.331
--What for?!
--Just do it! Run as far as you can!

00:22:03.355 --> 00:22:05.050
Run!

00:22:44.863 --> 00:22:50.412
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:50.436 --> 00:22:56.017
hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement

00:22:56.041 --> 00:23:01.690
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.714 --> 00:23:06.695
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.719 --> 00:23:12.234
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:12.258 --> 00:23:17.772
gently enveloped in love

00:23:17.796 --> 00:23:23.445
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.469 --> 00:23:28.984
but they will be reborn

00:23:29.008 --> 00:23:34.656
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:40.847
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:50.162 --> 00:23:51.994
"Next Episode”

00:23:55.367 --> 00:23:58.146
Gaia, who bears the name of a god.

00:23:58.170 --> 00:24:03.084
A battlefield philosopher
in tune with nature.

00:24:03.108 --> 00:24:08.790
His words separate and sway
the boy's mind and body.

00:24:08.814 --> 00:24:13.728
Cells! Remember how to attack and dodge!

00:24:13.752 --> 00:24:15.030
This is a fight!

00:24:15.054 --> 00:24:19.924
"Next Episode: Gaia"
